description	"The Jet Trooper - Rifleman

A special trooper covered in thick, magnetically plated armor. His jetpack is such that he can remain in the air for extended periods of time. He can be very difficult for a jedi to kill.

^2Weaponry:
- Imperial Heavy Repeater (2)
- Clone Pistol (2)

^8Attributes:
- Magnetic Plating
- CTF: 32s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack [No Fuel Use / Cooldown]

^2Strengths^7: Well armored, Mobile, and formidable against jedi, can fly for indefinate periods.
^1Weaknesses^7: Relatively low firepower, relies on mobility as a source of defense."